ble from all but the most technical contexts: just assume via convention th=
at when we put two measurement units in a tanru, we intend to multiply them=
. Then we can possibly build the lujvo {minlytolcacra} (though the La Bangu=
 project does want to avoid proliferating lujvo). This possibly fixes the p=
roblem that existing measurement-combination lujvo such as {cacryminli} hav=
e no standard as to how they should be constructed.
